{
  "rc": {
    "_note": "缓存省了多少(2026-10-08 新增,零新增请求):大数 = 近 30 天读缓存比按普通输入计价省下的钱(composition.cost.savedS,与页面 /tokens 同一个数);条 = 实付占「不用缓存的原价」多少(满条 = 原价,填充 = 实付)。\n条宽 < 1% 时不画填充(零宽圆角矩形会让整张组件渲不出来)。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "缓存省了",
        "empty": "等待首次同步",
        "sub": "近 30 天 · 按 API 标价",
        "hitA": "缓存命中 ",
        "hitB": "%",
        "paidA": "实付只占原价的 ",
        "paidB": "%",
        "paidE": "实付占原价 --"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "Savings",
        "empty": "Not synced yet",
        "sub": "Last 30 days · API prices",
        "hitA": "Cache hit rate ",
        "hitB": "%",
        "paidA": "You paid ",
        "paidB": "% of full price",
        "paidE": "Paid vs full price --"
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFA\\,#FBF3F1)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1C\\,#221E1F)@90",
        "_note": "缓存省了多少(2026-10-08 新增,零新增请求):大数 = 近 30 天读缓存比按普通输入计价省下的钱(composition.cost.savedS,与页面 /tokens 同一个数);条 = 实付占「不用缓存的原价」多少(满条 = 原价,填充 = 实付)。"
      },
      {
        "_note": "源色身份点:本包统一用 Claude 暖橙两档。",
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-92pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${cvS}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "big",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.26",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${cvS}",
            "fontSize": "26pt",
            "textColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${cvS}),k),0,1),1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.26+7.8pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "26pt",
            "textColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}*0.26+30pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.sub}",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${cvHit}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.26+45pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.hitA}${cvHit}${@i18n.hitB}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}-40pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "6pt",
        "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "3pt",
          "leftB": "3pt",
          "rightT": "3pt",
          "rightB": "3pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${cvW},0),0.01),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-40pt",
            "w": "({parent.w}-24pt)*${cvW}",
            "h": "6pt",
            "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "3pt",
              "leftB": "3pt",
              "rightT": "3pt",
              "rightB": "3pt"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${cvPaid}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-27pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.paidA}${cvPaid}${@i18n.paidB}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${cvPaid}),k),0,1),1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-27pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.paidE}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "时效锚:右上角、与卡名同一基线、9pt、右对齐(卡片设计系统 §3)。",
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "14pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},${@i18n.empty})]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      }
    ]
  }
}